### choose

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl choose forall dim {number} t u. (fn : t -> option u) (s : seq dim t) : seq dim u =\n    fun n =>\n        inl rec body fn s i i' =\n            match i |> s with\n            | None => None\n            | Some x =>\n                match x |> fn with\n                | Some x when n = i' => Some x\n                | Some _ => 루프 (i + 1) (i' + 1)\n                | _ => 루프 (i + 1) i'\n        and inl 루프 i i' =\n            if n |> var_is |> not\n            then body fn s i i'\n            else\n                inl fn = join fn\n                inl s = join s\n                join body fn s i i'\n        루프 0 0","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl choose forall dim {number} t u. (fn : t -> option u) (s : seq dim t) : seq dim u =
      fun n =>
          inl rec body fn s i i' =
              match i |> s with
              | None => None
              | Some x =>
                  match x |> fn with
                  | Some x when n = i' => Some x
                  | Some _ => 루프 (i + 1) (i' + 1)
                  | _ => 루프 (i + 1) i'
          and inl 루프 i i' =
              if n |> var_is |> not
              then body fn s i i'
              else
                  inl fn = join fn
                  inl s = join s
                  join body fn s i i'
          루프 0 0
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test\n\nlistm.init 10i32 print_and_return\n|> from_list\n|> choose (fun x => if x % 2 = 0 then Some x else None)\n|> try_item 1i32\n|> _assert_eq (Some 2i32)","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test

  listm.init 10i32 print_and_return
  |> from_list
  |> choose (fun x => if x % 2 = 0 then Some x else None)
  |> try_item 1i32
  |> _assert_eq (Some 2i32)
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

