### to_array

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl to_array seq =\n    inl ar = a ;[] |> mut\n    ((), seq)\n    ||> fold fun _ x =>\n        ar <- *ar ++ a ;[x]\n    *ar\n\ninl to_array_ seq =\n    inl ar = a ;[] |> mut\n    ((), seq)\n    ||> fold_ fun _ x =>\n        ar <- *ar ++ a ;[x]\n    *ar","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl to_array seq =
      inl ar = a ;[] |> mut
      ((), seq)
      ||> fold fun _ x =>
          ar <- *ar ++ a ;[x]
      *ar

  inl to_array_ seq =
      inl ar = a ;[] |> mut
      ((), seq)
      ||> fold_ fun _ x =>
          ar <- *ar ++ a ;[x]
      *ar
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

