### take_while

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl take_while cond seq =\n    inl rec 루프 acc i =\n        match seq i with\n        | Some st when cond st i => 루프 (st :: acc) (i + 1)\n        | _ => acc |> listm.rev\n    루프 [] 0","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl take_while cond seq =
      inl rec 루프 acc i =
          match seq i with
          | Some st when cond st i => 루프 (st :: acc) (i + 1)
          | _ => acc |> listm.rev
      루프 [] 0
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

