### seq'

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"type seq_switch' t =\n    {\n        Gleam : $'List(`t)'\n        Fsharp : $'`t seq'\n        Python : $'list'\n        Rust : $'Rc<Vec<`t>>'\n        TypeScript : $'Array<`t>'\n    }\nnominal seq' t = $'backend_switch `(seq_switch' t)'","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  type seq_switch' t =
      {
          Gleam : $'List(`t)'
          Fsharp : $'`t seq'
          Python : $'list'
          Rust : $'Rc<Vec<`t>>'
          TypeScript : $'Array<`t>'
      }
  nominal seq' t = $'backend_switch `(seq_switch' t)'
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

### length'

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl length' forall t. (items : seq' t) : int =\n    backend_switch {\n        Gleam = fun () =>\n            global \"import gleam/list\"\n            $'!items |> list.length' : int\n        Fsharp = fun () => items |> $'Seq.length' : int\n        Python = fun () => $'len(!items)' : int\n        Rust = fun () => $'(!items.len() as `int)' : int\n        TypeScript = fun () => $'!items.length' : int\n    }","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl length' forall t. (items : seq' t) : int =
      backend_switch {
          Gleam = fun () =>
              global "import gleam/list"
              $'!items |> list.length' : int
          Fsharp = fun () => items |> $'Seq.length' : int
          Python = fun () => $'len(!items)' : int
          Rust = fun () => $'(!items.len() as `int)' : int
          TypeScript = fun () => $'!items.length' : int
      }
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

