### new_seq

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl new_seq forall t. fn : seq' t =\n    backend_switch {\n        Gleam = fun () =>\n            $'!fn()' : seq' t\n        Fsharp = fun () =>\n            fun () =>\n                $'seq {'\n                fn |> indent\n                $'}' : ()\n            |> let'\n            |> fun x => x : seq' t\n        Python = fun () =>\n            $'list(!fn())' : seq' t\n    }","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl new_seq forall t. fn : seq' t =
      backend_switch {
          Gleam = fun () =>
              $'!fn()' : seq' t
          Fsharp = fun () =>
              fun () =>
                  $'seq {'
                  fn |> indent
                  $'}' : ()
              |> let'
              |> fun x => x : seq' t
          Python = fun () =>
              $'list(!fn())' : seq' t
      }
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

