### of_array'

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl of_array' forall dim t. (items : a dim t) : seq' t =\n    backend_switch {\n        Gleam = fun () =>\n            global \"import gary/array\"\n            $'!items |> array.to_list' : seq' t\n        Fsharp = fun () =>\n            fun () =>\n                $'for i = 0 to !items.Length - 1 do yield !items.[i]'\n            |> new_seq\n            |> fun x => x : seq' t\n        Python = fun () => $'[item for item in !items]' : seq' t\n        Rust = fun () => $'Rc::new(!items.borrow().clone())' : seq' t\n        TypeScript = fun () => $'[...!items]' : seq' t\n    }","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl of_array' forall dim t. (items : a dim t) : seq' t =
