### cast'

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl cast' forall t u. (items : u) : seq' t =\n    backend_switch {\n        Gleam = fun () => $'!items ' : seq' t\n        Fsharp = fun () => items |> $'Seq.cast' : seq' t\n        Python = fun () => $'list(!items)' : seq' t\n        // Rust: a seq'/list' (`Rc<Vec<t>>`) or an array as is, else anything `IntoIterator<Item = t>`.\n        Rust = fun () =>\n            inl x : seq' t =\n                real\n                    typecase u with\n                    | seq' ~x => $'(!items).clone()' : seq' t\n                    | listm'.list' ~x => $'(!items).clone()' : seq' t\n                    | array_base ~x => $'Rc::new(!items.borrow().clone())' : seq' t\n                    | a ~d ~x => $'Rc::new(!items.borrow().clone())' : seq' t\n                    | _ => $'Rc::new(IntoIterator::into_iter(!items).collect::<Vec<`t>>())' : seq' t\n            x\n        // TypeScript: an array or any iterable.\n        TypeScript = fun () => $'Array.from(!items)' : seq' t\n    }","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl cast' forall t u. (items : u) : seq' t =
      backend_switch {
          Gleam = fun () => $'!items ' : seq' t
          Fsharp = fun () => items |> $'Seq.cast' : seq' t
          Python = fun () => $'list(!items)' : seq' t
          // Rust: a seq'/list' (`Rc<Vec<t>>`) or an array as is, else anything `IntoIterator<Item = t>`.
          Rust = fun () =>
              inl x : seq' t =
                  real
                      typecase u with
                      | seq' ~x => $'(!items).clone()' : seq' t
                      | listm'.list' ~x => $'(!items).clone()' : seq' t
                      | array_base ~x => $'Rc::new(!items.borrow().clone())' : seq' t
                      | a ~d ~x => $'Rc::new(!items.borrow().clone())' : seq' t
                      | _ => $'Rc::new(IntoIterator::into_iter(!items).collect::<Vec<`t>>())' : seq' t
              x
          // TypeScript: an array or any iterable.
          TypeScript = fun () => $'Array.from(!items)' : seq' t
      }
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

### rev'

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl rev'' forall t. (items : seq' t) : seq' t =\n    backend_switch {\n        Gleam = fun () =>\n            global \"import gleam/list\"\n            $'!items |> list.reverse' : seq' t\n        Fsharp = fun () => items |> $'Seq.rev' : seq' t\n        Python = fun () => $'list(reversed(!items))' : seq' t\n        Rust = fun () => $'Rc::new({ let mut v = (!items).as_ref().clone(); v.reverse(); v })' : seq' t\n        TypeScript = fun () => $'[...!items].reverse()' : seq' t\n    }","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl rev'' forall t. (items : seq' t) : seq' t =
      backend_switch {
          Gleam = fun () =>
              global "import gleam/list"
              $'!items |> list.reverse' : seq' t
          Fsharp = fun () => items |> $'Seq.rev' : seq' t
          Python = fun () => $'list(reversed(!items))' : seq' t
          Rust = fun () => $'Rc::new({ let mut v = (!items).as_ref().clone(); v.reverse(); v })' : seq' t
          TypeScript = fun () => $'[...!items].reverse()' : seq' t
      }
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test\n///> fsharp\n///> cuda\n///> rust\n///> typescript\n\n[ \"a\"; \"b\" ]\n|> listm'.box\n|> of_list'\n|> rev''\n|> to_list'\n|> listm'.unbox\n|> _assert_eq [ \"b\"; \"a\" ]","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test
  ///> fsharp
  ///> cuda
  ///> rust
  ///> typescript

  [ "a"; "b" ]
  |> listm'.box
  |> of_list'
  |> rev''
  |> to_list'
  |> listm'.unbox
  |> _assert_eq [ "b"; "a" ]
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

## rust

